QuestGuidance.Register("en",402,{
[12833]="70020BA9\n1\tBring the tusks of the Black Sow to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan\tSaeradan is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith. You should bring the tusks of the Black Sow to Saeradan for his examination.\n",
[12834]="70071638\n1\tDefeat Eshen-erêz, the Bone-queen\030(Optional) Use the Aradûni Horn to call for Râsabur and begin the fight\tRâsabur needs your help defeating Eshen-erêz, the Bone-queen. You should go to the centre of Ushumût, signal Râsabur by blowing the Aradûni Horn, and then defeat Eshen-erêz, the Bone-queen.\n2\tTalk to Râsabur\tYou have defeated the Bone-queen. You should regroup with Râsabur near the rock where you first met.\n",
[12835]="700169BF\n1\tDefeat the grodbog-queen\tThe grodbog-queen is at Nud-heden, within the Chittering Hole, south-east of the Orc-watch. Auti is convinced the grodbog-infestation will not be resolved until their queen is defeated.\n2\tTalk to Auti at the Orc-watch\tAuti is at the Orc-watch, north-west of Nud-heden. Auti will be pleased to hear the grodbog-queen has been defeated and the insects have left Nud-heden.\n",
[12836]="70032C29\n1\tDefeat the grodbog-queen\tThe grodbog-queen in Nud-heden is laying eggs and nurturing larvae. She is creating a swarm to protect herself, while she continues to breed unharmed. You should defeat the grodbog-queen in Nud-heden.\n2\tDefeat the grodbog-queen\tThe grodbog-queen in Nud-heden is laying eggs and nurturing larvae. She is creating a swarm to protect herself, while she continues to breed unharmed. You should defeat the grodbog-queen in Nud-heden.\n3\tThe grodbog-queen is defeated\tThe grodbog-queen in Nud-heden is laying eggs and nurturing larvae. She is creating a swarm to protect herself, while she continues to breed unharmed. You should defeat the grodbog-queen in Nud-heden.\n",
[12837]="70062DD4\n1\tReach the water-wheel located at the bottom of the ravine before time runs out\tDervel Crintach challenged you to reach, before time runs out, the water-wheel located at the bottom of the ravine in which Glyn Helyg is built. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Addo Benchuth by the water-wheel\tAddo Benchuth is waiting to speak with you about your accomplishment.\n",
[12838]="70030BC1\n1\tEnter the first gate\tYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.\n2\tRide through the second gate\tYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tRide through the next gate\tYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tRide through the next gate\tYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tRide through the next gate\tYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tRide through the next gate\tYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n7\tRide through the next gate\tYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tRide through the next gate\tYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n9\tRide through the next gate\tYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tRide through the next gate\tYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n11\tRide through the next gate\tYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n12\tRide through the next gate\tYou have been challenged to race